(Jihwaja Motel)

814
00:52:41,003 --> 00:52:42,743
Hey, give some to your dad.

815
00:52:46,713 --> 00:52:50,113
- Uncle. - Ha Neul, you're here early.

816
00:52:50,413 --> 00:52:52,483
Hey, you look like a completely different person dressed like that.

817
00:52:53,323 --> 00:52:55,193
Well, I can't go to court in a sweatsuit.

818
00:52:55,353 --> 00:52:58,463
Uncle, you look so handsome. You look like a groom.

819
00:52:58,523 --> 00:53:00,663
Ha Neul, you shouldn't say things like that.

820
00:53:02,593 --> 00:53:04,293
- I'm off. - Okay.

821
00:53:05,433 --> 00:53:07,863
(Jihwaja Motel)

822
00:53:12,043 --> 00:53:13,103
Yes, Attorney Bae.

823
00:53:13,903 --> 00:53:15,373
It's the first day of the Domestic Affairs Investigation.

824
00:53:15,443 --> 00:53:16,673
How are you feeling?

825
00:53:17,543 --> 00:53:19,883
How do you think? It's not like I'm happy about it.

826
00:53:20,213 --> 00:53:22,683
She won't be too happy about it either,

827
00:53:23,583 --> 00:53:27,023
but you absolutely must not get worked up.

828
00:53:27,523 --> 00:53:29,493
No matter what unexpected situation arises,

829
00:53:29,553 --> 00:53:32,663
do not panic, and handle it calmly.

830
00:53:33,193 --> 00:53:34,193
Remember that.

831
00:53:34,823 --> 00:53:35,833
Yes.

832
00:53:42,773 --> 00:53:44,033
(Room 104, Domestic Affairs Investigation)

833
00:53:48,513 --> 00:53:50,273
(Yeonnam Family Court Bulletin)

834
00:53:54,343 --> 00:53:55,553
You seem awfully relaxed.

835
00:53:57,153 --> 00:53:58,153
What?

836
00:53:58,723 --> 00:54:00,723
You do not look nervous at all.

837
00:54:02,823 --> 00:54:03,823
Are you nervous?

838
00:54:04,323 --> 00:54:05,323
Me?

839
00:54:06,763 --> 00:54:07,763
No.

840
00:54:15,503 --> 00:54:16,503
Listen...

841
00:54:18,643 --> 00:54:20,943
I think I was being inconsiderate the other day.

842
00:54:24,013 --> 00:54:25,643
When I told you about Hee Ju,

843
00:54:26,343 --> 00:54:28,383
you know, about her taking those pills.

844
00:54:31,623 --> 00:54:35,393
I really did not mean for it to come out like that...

845
00:54:40,223 --> 00:54:41,223
Anyway, I am sorry.

846
00:54:42,293 --> 00:54:44,593
I was not thinking about how you would feel.

847
00:54:46,863 --> 00:54:47,863
It is fine.

848
00:54:49,533 --> 00:54:50,533
Really?

849
00:54:51,773 --> 00:54:52,773
Are you really okay?

850
00:54:53,003 --> 00:54:54,003
Yes.

851
00:54:54,673 --> 00:54:55,973
These things happen.

852
00:54:56,643 --> 00:54:57,643
Do not worry about it.

853
00:55:10,423 --> 00:55:11,823
You two may come in now.

854
00:55:20,763 --> 00:55:23,133
- Ji Won Ho. - Yes.

855
00:55:23,133 --> 00:55:25,473
Is your address Deungmi-dong, Seongsu-gu,

856
00:55:25,543 --> 00:55:28,273
Maesan Apartments, Building 802, Unit 501? Is that correct?

857
00:55:28,813 --> 00:55:30,013
Yes, that is correct.

858
00:55:30,073 --> 00:55:32,643
- Baek Mi Young. - Yes.

859
00:55:32,643 --> 00:55:35,183
Is your address Deungmi-dong, Seongsu-gu,

860
00:55:35,253 --> 00:55:38,183
Maesan Apartments, Building 802, Unit 501? Is that correct?

861
00:55:38,983 --> 00:55:39,983
Yes.

862
00:55:40,383 --> 00:55:41,623
And your current residence?

863
00:55:44,293 --> 00:55:45,593
We are living together.

864
00:55:46,863 --> 00:55:48,863
All right, then...

865
00:55:49,093 --> 00:55:52,263
shall we begin with the statement from the plaintiff, Baek Mi Young?

866
00:55:56,733 --> 00:55:57,873
All this time,

867
00:55:59,943 --> 00:56:02,343
I have lived only for my husband and our company.

868
00:56:04,813 --> 00:56:06,243
While I was married to my husband,

869
00:56:06,943 --> 00:56:08,883
we went through various crises.

870
00:56:12,523 --> 00:56:14,153
But for the most part,

871
00:56:14,823 --> 00:56:18,563
I tried to be understanding and supportive of him.

872
00:56:19,863 --> 00:56:21,763
We were not just husband and wife.

873
00:56:22,463 --> 00:56:23,963
We were also business partners.

874
00:56:26,033 --> 00:56:27,033
However,

875
00:56:28,903 --> 00:56:29,903
three years ago,

876
00:56:33,443 --> 00:56:35,413
after I suffered a miscarriage,

877
00:56:37,973 --> 00:56:40,283
I concluded that I could no longer spend the rest of my life...

878
00:56:42,053 --> 00:56:45,253
with the husband who caused me to miscarry.

879
00:56:45,323 --> 00:56:47,383
Wait a minute. What do you mean "caused you to miscarry"...

880
00:56:47,453 --> 00:56:48,453
Defendant.

881
00:56:49,023 --> 00:56:50,393
Please do not interrupt.

882
00:56:54,623 --> 00:56:56,693
The baby I had waited for so long,

883
00:56:59,303 --> 00:57:02,373
the baby I considered more precious than my own life,

884
00:57:05,143 --> 00:57:07,343
was suddenly taken from me one day.

885
00:57:11,613 --> 00:57:13,043
I resented the world,

886
00:57:13,683 --> 00:57:15,153
and I resented myself.

887
00:57:16,983 --> 00:57:18,523
I blamed myself...

888
00:57:19,183 --> 00:57:20,653
for failing to protect my baby...

889
00:57:22,593 --> 00:57:24,823
and even attempted to take my own life.

890
00:57:29,533 --> 00:57:30,533
And...

891
00:57:31,833 --> 00:57:33,003
all this time,

892
00:57:35,903 --> 00:57:37,673
in order to protect my husband,

893
00:57:40,073 --> 00:57:43,043
I was going to take this secret to my grave.

894
00:57:45,613 --> 00:57:46,683
But today,

895
00:57:48,813 --> 00:57:49,913
I'm gathering my courage...

896
00:57:53,383 --> 00:57:56,623
to reveal the secret I've kept in my heart...

897
00:57:58,353 --> 00:57:59,923
for the past three years.

898
00:58:04,363 --> 00:58:05,363
I...

899
00:58:09,733 --> 00:58:11,403
took medication that my husband gave me...

900
00:58:12,873 --> 00:58:14,073
and lost my baby.

901
00:58:19,383 --> 00:58:23,213
He gave me medication that I should have never taken.

902
00:58:27,083 --> 00:58:28,083
My husband...

903
00:58:29,523 --> 00:58:30,853
is a murderer...

904
00:58:31,593 --> 00:58:32,593
who killed our baby.

905
00:58:47,073 --> 00:58:50,043
(Epilogue)

906
00:59:34,183 --> 00:59:36,193
She should eat before she goes to bed.

907
01:00:12,063 --> 01:00:14,993
(OK! Let's Get Divorced)

908
01:00:15,293 --> 01:00:16,293
The pills?

909
01:00:17,663 --> 01:00:18,703
You really don't remember?

910
01:00:18,763 --> 01:00:20,403
This is extremely serious.

911
01:00:21,003 --> 01:00:22,703
You'd better think about how you're going...

912
01:00:22,773 --> 01:00:23,773
to deal with the fallout.

913
01:00:24,503 --> 01:00:27,603
I can't wait to see what you do to me now.

914
01:00:28,143 --> 01:00:29,143
Hold on.

915
01:00:29,213 --> 01:00:30,443
It can't be...

916
01:00:30,443 --> 01:00:32,583
The person who gave the pills...

917
01:00:32,983 --> 01:00:34,143
Calvin did it.

918
01:00:34,283 --> 01:00:35,353
Do you remember...

919
01:00:35,653 --> 01:00:37,553
the pills you sent to Mi Young three years ago?

920
01:00:37,613 --> 01:00:40,053
Revenge or not, bring me proof.

921
01:00:40,053 --> 01:00:41,653
Would I be able to forgive the person...

922
01:00:42,023 --> 01:00:43,853
who gave me the wrong pills if it wasn't you?

923
01:00:44,853 --> 01:00:48,023
No. I only put up with it because it was you.
